### Base URL (adjust port if different)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5159

### 1️⃣ Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json


### 2️⃣ Register a new User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "GoodPass123!",
  "role": "User"
}


### 3️⃣ Register an Admin (optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPass123!",
  "role": "Admin"
}


### 4️⃣ Login as User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "GoodPass123!"
}

 

### 5️⃣ Login as Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPass123!"
}


### 6️⃣ Create Vault Item (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vault
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "My first secure note <script>alert('xss')</script>"
}


### 7️⃣ List My Vault Items (User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vault
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 8️⃣ List All Vault Items (Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vault/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 9️⃣ Delete a Vault Item (User or Admin)
# Replace {id} with an actual item ID returned from the list endpoints
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/vault/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json
